400
00:29:10,540 --> 00:29:12,417
<font color="white">Ayah sangat merindukannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:29:13,209 --> 00:29:14,502
<font color="white">Hari ini? Ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

402
00:29:15,420 --> 00:29:16,421
<font color="white">Sepertinya begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:29:19,924 --> 00:29:21,968
<font color="white">Kau juga sangat rindu ibumu, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:29:25,388 --> 00:29:26,598
<font color="white">Ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:29:28,475 --> 00:29:29,309
<font color="white">Sepertinya</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:29:30,852 --> 00:29:32,645
<font color="white">aku makin merindukannya dibanding dulu.</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:29:35,356 --> 00:29:38,526
<font color="white">Dulu rasanya hanya sedih dan sulit,</font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:29:39,986 --> 00:29:42,489
<font color="white">aku tak tahu harus berbuat apa.</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:29:42,989 --> 00:29:44,407
<font color="white">Tapi sekarang ini…</font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:29:46,576 --> 00:29:48,077
<font color="white">yang aku tahu hanyalah…</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:29:51,706 --> 00:29:52,874
<font color="white">aku merindukannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:30:04,385 --> 00:30:05,386
<font color="white">Makanya</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:30:06,930 --> 00:30:08,223
<font color="white">aku berharap</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:30:09,974 --> 00:30:12,268
