00:30:21,653 --> 00:30:23,905
<font color="white">dan sesekali keluar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk bersenang-senang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

419
00:30:25,281 --> 00:30:26,783
<font color="white">Aku ingin Ayah begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:30:27,867 --> 00:30:29,118
<font color="white">Memikirkan ibumu</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:30:30,328 --> 00:30:32,080
<font color="white">dan merindukannya…</font><font color="white"></font>

422
