<font color="white">bukanlah masa sulit.</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:30:39,420 --> 00:30:42,423
<font color="white">Rasanya menyenangkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bisa memikirkan ibumu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

424
00:30:44,926 --> 00:30:46,094
<font color="white">Memang menyenangkan…</font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:30:48,054 --> 00:30:49,013
<font color="white">tapi maksudku,</font><font color="white"></font>

426
