<font color="white">aku mau Ayah lebih banyak menikmati hidup.</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:30:59,023 --> 00:31:00,108
<font color="white">Baiklah.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:04,737
<font color="white">Kau makin sering mengomel sekarang.</font><font color="white"></font>

