00:32:11,971 --> 00:32:12,889
<font color="white">Kawan.</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:32:13,431 --> 00:32:15,683
<font color="white">- Dia pacar pertamamu?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Jangan bahas ini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

