00:32:15,767 --> 00:32:17,727
<font color="white">- Ada apa denganmu?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Dengar, Nak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

447
00:32:18,519 --> 00:32:20,021
<font color="white">Pacaran itu seperti ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

448
00:32:20,605 --> 00:32:23,608
<font color="white">Jika tak menuruti ucapannya,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kau bisa dalam masalah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

449
00:32:23,691 --> 00:32:26,110
<font color="white">Tapi jika hanya menuruti ucapannya,</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:32:26,194 --> 00:32:27,528
<font color="white">masalahmu bisa lebih besar.</font><font color="white"></font>

451
00:32:29,572 --> 00:32:30,573
<font color="white">Apa maksudnya itu?</font><font color="white"></font>

452
00:32:31,783 --> 00:32:32,825
<font color="white">Apa yang kau lakukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

