454
00:32:35,662 --> 00:32:36,704
<font color="white">Cinta itu menyakitkan.</font><font color="white"></font>

455
00:32:37,538 --> 00:32:38,790
<font color="white">Lihat?</font><font color="white"></font>

456
00:32:38,873 --> 00:32:40,083
<font color="white">Ini soal momen yang pas.</font><font color="white"></font>

457
