00:32:45,380 --> 00:32:46,839
<font color="white">Ada apa denganmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:32:46,923 --> 00:32:48,424
<font color="white">Sudah cukup!</font><font color="white"></font>

460
00:32:48,508 --> 00:32:50,051
<font color="white">Hei, hentikan!</font><font color="white"></font>

461
00:32:51,719 --> 00:32:53,513
