<font color="white"><i>Jadi, kau mau bicara apa?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

625
00:47:59,501 --> 00:48:01,628
<font color="white">Terima kasih sudah meneleponku kemarin.</font><font color="white"></font>

626
00:48:02,212 --> 00:48:03,672
<font color="white">Tidak perlu berterima kasih.</font><font color="white"></font>

627
00:48:04,881 --> 00:48:07,676
<font color="white">Aku hanya melakukan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">apa yang ingin dan bisa kulakukan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

628
00:48:10,304 --> 00:48:11,305
<font color="white">Benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

629
00:48:11,388 --> 00:48:13,807
<font color="white">Sangat berbahaya jika rumor tersebar</font><font color="white"></font>

630
00:48:14,474 --> 00:48:15,809
<font color="white">soal gangguan memorinya.</font><font color="white"></font>

631
00:48:17,644 --> 00:48:21,064
<font color="white">Karena apa pun yang terjadi,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Seo-yoon tak akan mengingatnya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

632
00:48:21,690 --> 00:48:22,524
<font color="white">Kau benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

633
00:48:24,067 --> 00:48:26,236
<font color="white">Tidak semua orang di dunia ini baik.</font><font color="white"></font>

634
00:48:28,280 --> 00:48:29,531
<font color="white">Omong-omong…</font><font color="white"></font>

635
00:48:32,784 --> 00:48:33,952
<font color="white">apa kau orang baik?</font><font color="white"></font>

636
00:48:40,959 --> 00:48:41,960
<font color="white">Aku hanya</font><font color="white"></font>

637
00:48:43,378 --> 00:48:45,797
