<font color="white">adalah hari baik untuknya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

638
00:48:46,673 --> 00:48:47,841
<font color="white">Aku ingin jurnalnya</font><font color="white"></font>

639
00:48:48,342 --> 00:48:50,636
<font color="white">diisi dengan kenangan indah.</font><font color="white"></font>

640
00:48:53,513 --> 00:48:56,725
<font color="white">Aku sudah memintanya</font><font color="white">
