646
00:49:17,037 --> 00:49:17,954
<font color="white">aku juga takut.</font><font color="white"></font>

647
00:49:18,705 --> 00:49:19,873
<font color="white">Apa maksudmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

648
00:49:22,417 --> 00:49:23,251
<font color="white">Pokoknya,</font><font color="white"></font>

649
