<font color="white">sepertinya aku bisa memercayaimu sekarang.</font><font color="white"></font>

650
00:49:27,714 --> 00:49:28,548
<font color="white">Benarkah?</font><font color="white"></font>

651
00:49:29,132 --> 00:49:31,468
{\an8}<font color="white">Jangan lepas tangan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan meninggalkannya nanti.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

652
00:49:32,052 --> 00:49:32,928
