661
00:49:56,993 --> 00:49:58,203
<font color="white">Aku sedang pegang pisau.</font><font color="white"></font>

662
00:49:59,329 --> 00:50:00,247
<font color="white">Ayah iri.</font><font color="white"></font>

663
00:50:01,790 --> 00:50:04,042
<font color="white">Apa maksud Ayah?</font><font color="white"></font>

664
00:50:04,126 --> 00:50:05,335
