665
00:50:05,419 --> 00:50:06,461
<font color="white">Benar juga.</font><font color="white"></font>

666
00:50:07,546 --> 00:50:09,840
<font color="white">Ayah perlu memberimu uang saku.</font><font color="white"></font>

667
00:50:10,382 --> 00:50:13,093
