674
00:50:41,663 --> 00:50:45,250
<font color="white">Aku ingin bertemu Seo-yoon saja.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kenapa bisa begini?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

675
00:50:46,209 --> 00:50:47,127
<font color="white">Kenapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

676
00:50:48,920 --> 00:50:51,131
<font color="white">Kenapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

677
00:50:52,340 --> 00:50:53,925
<font color="white">Akhirnya!</font><font color="white"></font>

678
00:50:54,426 --> 00:50:56,011
<font color="white">Ujian sudah beres, kita mau apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

679
00:50:57,429 --> 00:50:58,680
<font color="white">Apa, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

680
00:50:59,347 --> 00:51:02,184
<font color="white">Apa yang begitu seru</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sampai membuat orang lain iri?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

